        "topic": "Financial Ratios",
        "question_type": "Objective",
        "exam_year": "2023",
        "question_text": "<p>If a company's current assets are $50,000, current liabilities are $25,000, and inventory is $10,000, what is the <b>quick ratio</b>?</p>",
